  "solution": "Given equation: 31 * 6 * 19 * 81 * 24 * 3 * 52\n\nBODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a45b5b9191c13cd4da310eb8df100becb078c240f4b0e763420ec154fb42a5fd.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1: ÷, +, =, ×, −, +\n\nGiven: 31 * 6 * 19 * 81 * 24 * 3 * 52\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**31 ÷ 6**__ + 19 = 81 × 24 - 3 + 52\n\n⇒ 5.16 + 19 = __**81 × 24**__ - 3 + 52\n\n⇒ __**5.16 + 19**__ = 1944 - 3 + 52\n\n⇒ 24.16 = __**1944 - 3**__ + 52\n\n⇒ 24.16 = __**1941 + 52**__\n\n⇒ 24.16 = 1993\n\n(This option is incorrect)\n\nOption 2: ×, +, −, =, ×, +\n\nGiven: 31 * 6 * 19 * 81 * 24 * 3 * 52\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**31 × 6**__ + 19 - 81 = __**24 × 3**__ + 52\n\n⇒ __**186 + 19**__ - 81 = 72 + 52\n\n⇒ __**205 - 81**__ = __**72 + 52**__\n\n⇒ 124 = 124\n\n**(This option is correct)**\n\nOption 3: +, =, ×, −, +, −\n\nGiven: 31 * 6 * 19 * 81 * 24 * 3 * 52\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**31 + 6**__ = __**19 × 81**__ - 24 + 3 - 52\n\n⇒ 37 = 1539 - 24 + 3 - 52\n\n⇒ 37 = __**1515 + 3**__ - 52\n\n⇒ 37 = __**1518 - 52**__\n\n⇒ 37 = 1466\n\n(This option is incorrect)\n\nOption 4: =, −, ×, +, −, ÷\n\nGiven: 31 * 6 * 19 * 81 * 24 * 3 * 52\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get:\n\n⇒ 31 = 6 - __**19 × 81**__ + 24 - __**3 ÷ 52**__\n\n⇒ 31 = 6 - 1539 + 24 - 0.05\n\n⇒ 31 = __**-1533 + 24**__ - 0.05\n\n⇒ 31 = __**-1509 - 0.05**__\n\n⇒ 31 = -1509.05\n\n(This option is incorrect)\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
